    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "RAG advisor chain — avg and p95 by advisor",
      "description": "Time spent inside each ChatClient advisor, as both the mean and the p95. QuestionAnswerAdvisor is the pgvector similarity search that grounds a chat answer, so this separates retrieval cost from generation cost. The two series answer different questions and were previously on two different dashboards: the mean tracks steady-state cost, while the gap between mean and p95 is what exposes an occasional slow retrieval that an average hides.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 25
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
