          "expr": "sum(rate(spring_ai_advisor_seconds_sum{application=\"spring-ai-ragr\"}[5m])) by (spring_ai_advisor_name) / sum(rate(spring_ai_advisor_seconds_count{application=\"spring-ai-ragr\"}[5m])) by (spring_ai_advisor_name)",
