  "description": "Everything model- and retrieval-specific: Ollama call behaviour, token throughput, the RAG advisor chain and the pgvector store. Moved here from the overview dashboard so that one answers \"is the application healthy\" and this one answers \"is the AI pipeline healthy\"."
}
